      ],
      "gaps": [
        "When no tracing sample was valid, MinHitDistance is set to -1 (LumenScreenProbeFiltering.usf:148) and EncodeProbeHitDistanceForFiltering(-1) takes sqrt of a negative number; the resulting NaN converted to UNORM8 has no defined value. Treat such texels as invalid via ScreenProbeTraceMoving/coverage rather than decoding a sentinel from this byte.",
        "Additionally, the encoder and the source decoder are not exact inverses (bias applied before vs after the square), so d_src carries a systematic bias whose size depends on the code."
      ],
