        {
          "name": "EncodedHitDistance",
          "type": "UNORM8",
          "decode": "code/255 = E = sqrt(d/GetProbeMaxHitDistance())*254/255 + 1/255; the source consumer decodes L = E*E*MaxHalfFloat, d_src = (L - 1/255)*255/254 (not the exact inverse of the encoder)",
